WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.000
The little llama shows you how a draw that nobody can rig is done.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.000
Before the draw, the list of names is sealed.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
It stays in plain view, and nobody can erase or change it.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.000
Nobody picks the winner: it comes out of a public number.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
It is published by a tower of numbers, in plain sight.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Neither Tinkazo nor the organizer can pick that number.

7
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.000
The public number lands on the list and points at someone.

8
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
It lands on Sofía, third on the sealed list.

9
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.500
Don't take my word for it: from the receipt, anyone can redo it.

10
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.000
On the organizer's phone, or any other phone: the winner is the same.

11
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:34.000
If someone changes a name, the list no longer matches: cheating gets caught.

12
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.000
And by the way: there are ten games, and all draw with this same method.

13
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:42.000
You don't have to trust me: every step can be checked.

14
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Tinkazo: fair draws for your community.
